sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant RAG as RAG Hook
    participant TM as ToolManager
    participant FC as FallbackChain
    participant RL as RateLimitTracker
    participant OR as OpenRouter
    participant CH as Chutes
    participant CB as CircuitBreaker

    C->>GW: POST /v1/chat/completions
    GW->>RAG: augment with codebase context
    RAG-->>GW: enriched messages
    GW->>TM: compress tools
    TM-->>GW: compressed tool list
    GW->>FC: Complete(req)

    FC->>RL: ShouldSkip("openrouter")?
    Note over RL: false — no exhaustion recorded
    RL-->>FC: false, proceed
    FC->>OR: Complete(req)
    OR-->>FC: 429 Too Many Requests

    FC->>RL: mark exhausted, ParseRetryAfter(headers)
    Note over RL: exponential backoff if no Retry-After header
    RL-->>FC: cooldown duration set

    FC->>RL: ShouldSkip("chutes")?
    Note over RL: false — quota not exhausted
    RL-->>FC: false, proceed
    FC->>CH: Complete(req)
    CH-->>FC: 200 OK (response)

    FC->>CB: RecordSuccess("chutes")
    CB-->>FC: circuit remains closed
    FC->>RL: UpdateFromHeaders("chutes", headers)
    RL-->>FC: remaining quota stored
    FC-->>GW: response

    alt Streaming requested
        GW-->>C: SSE stream (chunked)
    else Non-streaming
        GW->>GW: Compress (Brotli/gzip)
        GW-->>C: 200 OK (JSON response)
    end
